#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function"
msgstr "Funzione"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a function to move a bot."
msgstr "Crea una funzione per spostare un robot."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move"
msgstr "Move"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The <a object|bottr>bot</a> must pass over all the <a object|waypoint>blue "
"crosses</a> on the ground. The way that must be covered is made of two "
"squares. The first one measures 15 meters, the second 25 meters."
msgstr ""
"Il <a object|bottr>robot</a> deve attraversare tutte le <a "
"object|waypoint>croci blu</a>. Il percorso forma due quadrati, uno di 15 "
"metri di lato e l’altro di 25."

#. type: Image filename
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "tproc1a"
msgstr "tproc1a"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "General principle"
msgstr "Principio generale"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order to solve this problem, the most efficient solution consists in "
"creating a <a cbot|function>function</a> that instructs the bot to move on a"
" square shape of a certain size. The main program becomes then very "
"simple:<c/>"
msgstr ""
"La soluzione più efficiente è una <a cbot|function>funzione</a> che faccia "
"percorrere un quadrato della dimensione specificata. Il programma principale"
" diventa semplicissimo:<c/>"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\textern void object::Function3( )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tSquare(15);\n"
"\t\tSquare(25);\n"
"\t}"
msgstr ""
"\textern void object::Function3( )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tSquare(15);\n"
"\t\tSquare(25);\n"
"\t}"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Useful instructions"
msgstr "Istruzioni utili"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> loop to repeat some instructions\n"
"<code><a cbot|move>move</a></code> to move the bot\n"
"<code><a cbot|turn>turn</a></code> to turn the bot"
msgstr ""
"Ciclo <code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> per ripetere istruzioni\n"
"<code><a cbot|move>move</a></code> per spostare il robot\n"
"<code><a cbot|turn>turn</a></code> per ruotarlo"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
"cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
